Reverend Sattha?

7
00:00:06,920 --> 00:00:08,080
What do you have to say?

8
00:00:08,160 --> 00:00:10,000
I deny every accusation.

9
00:00:10,880 --> 00:00:13,120
The police said the CCTV was broken.

10
00:00:13,480 --> 00:00:14,960
Then drug him.

11
00:00:16,160 --> 00:00:17,600
Let's give up on revenge.

12
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,400
If I hadn't found God that day,

13
00:00:19,840 --> 00:00:21,400
I'd be dead.

14
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:22,920
Now that Chris is your bitch,

15
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,920
you sympathize with them?!

16
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,080
Do you love Non?

17
00:00:27,160 --> 00:00:28,200
No.

18
00:00:28,280 --> 00:00:29,920
It wasn't love.

19
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:31,000
But…

20
00:00:31,080 --> 00:00:33,520
I liked how Non made me feel.

21
00:00:42,560 --> 00:00:43,560
Nalin?

22
00:00:56,840 --> 00:00:57,840
Nalin...

23
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,840
You abandoned me.

24
00:01:05,920 --> 00:01:07,200
I'll kill Chris.

25
00:01:08,160 --> 00:01:10,240
Then Marisa and Tulya

26
00:01:10,320 --> 00:01:12,440
will suffer like we did when Mom died.

27
00:01:13,320 --> 00:01:14,120
Let go!

28
00:01:14,200 --> 00:01:15,800
We made a promise, remember?

29
00:01:15,880 --> 00:01:16,880
Let go!

30
00:01:27,920 --> 00:01:29,080
Non!

31
00:01:30,080 --> 00:01:31,880
Non!

32
00:01:34,640 --> 00:01:35,640
Non...

33
00:02:07,080 --> 00:02:09,560
Jump, Non! Jump!

34
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:11,320
Hurry up!

35
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:13,560
Why are you so scared?

36
00:02:13,640 --> 00:02:15,040
You can do it, Non!

37
00:02:15,120 --> 00:02:17,040
Mom, look! Non's going all pale.

38
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,680
Not everyone's as brave as you.

39
00:02:21,200 --> 00:02:23,120
Jump, Non! Come on!

40
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,600
No!

41
00:02:25,200 --> 00:02:26,720
Hurry!

42
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,040
- Come on! Hurry!
- Hurry!

43
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:31,840
- Come on, Non!
- You can do it!

44
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:33,120
Jump! Jump!

45
00:02:36,160 --> 00:02:38,240
So? Were you scared when you jumped?

46
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:39,920
I was terrified.

47
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:41,040
Come on.

48
00:02:42,320 --> 00:02:44,120
Let's come back another day.

49
00:02:45,680 --> 00:02:48,240
Always dragging your brother
into mischief, huh?

50
00:02:48,320 --> 00:02:51,160
And you, Non. You never stop her.

51
00:02:55,840 --> 00:02:57,920
You two only have each other.

52
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
You have to love each other, okay?

53
00:03:00,080 --> 00:03:03,040
Lin, behave and listen to your brother.

54
00:03:56,760 --> 00:03:58,400
Let's give up on revenge.

55
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:08,600
God is telling us
to stop obsessing over revenge, Lin.

56
00:04:13,320 --> 00:04:15,200
We should learn to forgive.

57
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:19,160
Forgive?

58
00:04:19,880 --> 00:04:21,440
What the hell even is that?

59
00:04:22,240 --> 00:04:27,800
MARISA PORNHOVA
"ART IS THE ONLY WAY I PRAY"

60
00:05:54,160 --> 00:05:57,960
Pupee, make a new TikTok promo for Eden.

61
00:05:58,040 --> 00:05:59,760
And go easy on the filters.

62
00:05:59,840 --> 00:06:01,320
They hide the beauty of my art.

63
00:06:01,400 --> 00:06:02,400
Yes, ma'am.

64
00:06:03,720 --> 00:06:06,200
Who put this filthy black cloth
over my painting?

65
00:06:09,720 --> 00:06:11,480
Uh... I don't know.

66
00:06:12,200 --> 00:06:14,560
I thought you ordered Song to do it.

67
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,400
Are you crazy? Why would I do that?

68
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:18,720
Take it off.

69
00:06:18,800 --> 00:06:20,240
Yes, of course.

70
00:06:22,320 --> 00:06:24,160
Get it off!

71
00:06:28,520 --> 00:06:32,240
THERE'S A DEAD BODY UNDER GOD'S HAND,
WAITING FOR HIS CONFESSION

72
00:06:37,800 --> 00:06:42,280
