WAITING FOR HIS CONFESSION

73
00:06:42,360 --> 00:06:42,880
GOD

74
00:06:42,960 --> 00:06:43,520
A DEAD BODY

75
00:06:43,600 --> 00:06:44,120
DEAD

76
00:06:44,200 --> 00:06:45,200
CONFESSION

77
00:06:45,280 --> 00:06:46,320
Close the gallery.

78
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:51,720
THERE'S A DEAD BODY UNDER GOD'S HAND,
WAITING FOR HIS CONFESSION

79
00:07:09,160 --> 00:07:12,000
It had to be Non's sister.

80
00:07:12,840 --> 00:07:14,840
I had Pupee check every camera,

81
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,360
but they'd all been unplugged.

82
00:07:16,440 --> 00:07:18,080
Nothing was recorded.

83
00:07:18,160 --> 00:07:19,360
That vile bitch.

84
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:21,920
Unplugged?

85
00:07:23,920 --> 00:07:26,280
Just like the night of the murder.

86
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:29,000
Someone had unplugged the DVR.

87
00:07:29,080 --> 00:07:30,680
I didn't want to leave it there,

88
00:07:30,760 --> 00:07:31,960
so I brought it back.

89
00:07:34,720 --> 00:07:36,520
So she knows her way around here.

90
00:07:38,800 --> 00:07:41,640
Non's sister may have been here that night.

91
00:07:42,600 --> 00:07:44,680
Then we have to find her.

92
00:07:44,760 --> 00:07:46,200
THERE'S A DEAD BODY UNDER GOD'S HAND

93
00:07:55,440 --> 00:07:56,960
You sound happy.

94
00:07:57,520 --> 00:07:58,560
Do I?

95
00:07:59,160 --> 00:08:00,560
I sound happy?

96
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:04,000
So?

97
00:08:05,400 --> 00:08:07,040
Did you find what I told you to look for?

98
00:08:08,160 --> 00:08:10,160
And don't tell anyone about this.

99
00:08:11,520 --> 00:08:13,320
Not about the phone or the DVR.

100
00:08:16,200 --> 00:08:17,240
No.

101
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:23,120
Really?

102
00:08:26,000 --> 00:08:27,000
Yeah.

103
00:08:29,560 --> 00:08:30,560
Never mind.

104
00:08:31,560 --> 00:08:33,960
Even if your dad did kill Non,

105
00:08:35,040 --> 00:08:36,680
you'd keep quiet,

106
00:08:37,680 --> 00:08:38,960
just like your mom does.

107
00:08:44,520 --> 00:08:45,920
Let me ask you something.

108
00:08:46,320 --> 00:08:48,920
Why are you so sure my dad did it?

109
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,680
Someone else could've framed him.

110
00:08:51,400 --> 00:08:52,480
What do you know?

111
00:08:55,160 --> 00:08:57,080
I know. I know very well.

112
00:08:57,520 --> 00:08:59,800
It doesn't matter who in your family did it.

113
00:08:59,880 --> 00:09:01,160
It could be your dad,

114
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,480
your grandpa,

115
00:09:02,560 --> 00:09:03,840
your grandma,

116
00:09:06,360 --> 00:09:08,320
or even your maid,

117
00:09:11,040 --> 00:09:13,160
and your mom could make it all legal.

118
00:09:25,760 --> 00:09:27,680
My mom never breaks the law.

119
00:09:30,560 --> 00:09:31,720
You're pretty persistent.

120
00:09:35,120 --> 00:09:36,120
Are you sure?

121
00:09:40,040 --> 00:09:41,160
Prove it.

122
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:46,000
Have you reported it to the police yet?

123
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:48,760
We can't. If they find out,

124
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:50,720
things will get out of hand.

125
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,480
Is this because of Chris?

126
00:09:53,840 --> 00:09:56,960
You still think
he'll become Council president?

127
00:09:57,720 --> 00:10:00,160
You know what really happened.

128
00:10:00,240 --> 00:10:01,480
Chris did nothing wrong.

129
00:10:04,880 --> 00:10:07,800
Hold on. Can't we get her details
from the police?

130
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:10,880
Like her house registration
or ID card details?

131
00:10:10,960 --> 00:10:12,320
That's illegal.

132
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:14,840
Then pay them.

133
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:20,480
Go on. Keep rolling your eyes.

134
00:10:20,560 --> 00:10:22,840
Are you trying to see inside your own head?

135
00:10:22,920 --> 00:10:24,880
Maybe you'll find a solution up there.

136
00:10:25,400 --> 00:10:27,680
If you're going to lash out at me,

137
00:10:28,120 --> 00:10:29,280
I'm leaving.

138
00:10:40,920 --> 00:10:42,320
Oh, that's right.

139
00:10:43,360 --> 00:10:44,440
That's it!

140
00:10:44,520 --> 00:10:46,560
Apple, the Forbidden Fruit.

141
00:10:49,240 --> 00:10:50,480
God bless you.

142
00:10:51,120 --> 00:10:53,560
If Non attended the auction that night...

143
00:10:53,880 --> 00:10:57,280
Anyone without an invitation had to show ID.

144
00:10:58,520 --> 00:11:00,000
Pupee!

145
00:11:15,920 --> 00:11:17,600
There's no one listed under that name.

146
00:11:17,680 --> 00:11:19,560
Mr. Non Sa-nguankhun, right?

147
00:11:20,320 --> 00:11:21,440
Yes.

148
00:11:23,720 --> 00:11:26,120
Is that the person who died here?

149
00:11:32,280 --> 00:11:33,680
Oh, I remember now.

150
00:11:35,040 --> 00:11:36,960
APPLE: THE FORBIDDEN FRUIT

151
00:11:37,040 --> 00:11:39,720
THAI NATIONAL ID CARD
MISS NALIN SA-NGUANKHUN

152
00:11:40,320 --> 00:11:41,480
APPLE: THE FORBIDDEN FRUIT

153
00:11:41,560 --> 00:11:42,800
Please sign here.

154
00:11:54,200 --> 00:11:55,400
Enjoy the evening.

155
00:12:08,480 --> 00:12:09,480
Here.

156
00:12:10,240 --> 00:12:11,480
Sa-nguankhun.

157
00:12:14,560 --> 00:12:16,320
"Miss Nalin Sa-nguankhun."

