160
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:33,240
DEAD

161
00:12:33,320 --> 00:12:39,440
A DEAD BODY

162
00:12:39,520 --> 00:12:40,600
What happened, Mom?

163
00:12:41,280 --> 00:12:42,480
Who did this?

164
00:12:43,680 --> 00:12:45,040
Non's sister, of course.

165
00:12:45,920 --> 00:12:47,040
Non's sister?

166
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,160
She hung it on the painting.

167
00:13:02,040 --> 00:13:04,880
Keep it safe. Don't let anyone take it again.

168
00:13:08,040 --> 00:13:09,200
I'm giving this back to you.

169
00:13:10,280 --> 00:13:11,880
My sister doesn't want to see it.

170
00:13:13,080 --> 00:13:14,240
She hates God.

171
00:13:16,120 --> 00:13:17,280
So I'm returning it.

172
00:13:20,000 --> 00:13:21,520
It isn't mine anymore.

173
00:13:24,320 --> 00:13:25,880
Not since the day I sinned.

174
00:13:35,520 --> 00:13:37,840
Then let it be with someone
who can own up to it.

175
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:53,720
"There's a dead body under God's hand.

176
00:13:54,760 --> 00:13:55,920
A dead body...

177
00:13:56,880 --> 00:13:58,560
waiting for his confession."

178
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:03,840
How are you sure it was Non's sister?

179
00:14:04,800 --> 00:14:07,160
Who else would have this necklace?

180
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:09,640
Those two have no fear of the Lord.

181
00:14:11,400 --> 00:14:13,840
Do you know who Non's sister is yet?

182
00:14:31,800 --> 00:14:34,400
THERE'S A DEAD BODY UNDER GOD'S HAND,
WAITING FOR HIS CONFESSION

183
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:36,560
PORNHOVA CHURCH COMMUNITY

184
00:14:41,800 --> 00:14:45,520
Nan, why did you take me here?

185
00:14:46,560 --> 00:14:47,920
Didn't you want to make sure

186
00:14:48,000 --> 00:14:49,720
that your mom has never broken the law?

187
00:14:58,200 --> 00:15:00,720
This was my childhood home.

188
00:15:04,040 --> 00:15:06,680
We used to eat over here.

189
00:15:07,480 --> 00:15:08,480
We'd watch TV...

190
00:15:10,640 --> 00:15:11,680
by this post.

191
00:15:13,760 --> 00:15:15,040
I did my homework

192
00:15:16,680 --> 00:15:18,200
in that corner.

193
00:15:20,360 --> 00:15:21,640
And in that little nook,

194
00:15:23,440 --> 00:15:25,600
we used to keep a small birdcage.

195
00:15:29,200 --> 00:15:30,360
Then one day,

196
00:15:32,160 --> 00:15:33,400
it all burned down

197
00:15:34,760 --> 00:15:35,920
in a gas explosion.

198
00:15:38,120 --> 00:15:39,960
My parents died in the fire.

199
00:15:43,720 --> 00:15:45,240
I'm sorry.

200
00:15:49,320 --> 00:15:50,400
Did you know about it?

201
00:15:52,160 --> 00:15:53,280
Yeah.

202
00:15:54,560 --> 00:15:56,560
My parents told me

203
00:15:56,640 --> 00:15:59,000
there was a huge fire
here the day I was born.

204
00:16:00,200 --> 00:16:01,800
My mom was trapped here too,

205
00:16:02,160 --> 00:16:03,560
but my dad saved her in time.

206
00:16:05,960 --> 00:16:08,400
Well, this is your mom's doing!

207
00:16:09,880 --> 00:16:11,160
If you've got something to say,

208
00:16:11,920 --> 00:16:13,320
explain it properly.

209
00:16:13,760 --> 00:16:15,080
I'm willing to listen.

210
00:16:15,480 --> 00:16:17,120
But don't play mind games with me.

211
00:16:18,480 --> 00:16:20,320
My dad was your family's driver.

212
00:16:22,600 --> 00:16:24,360
He was close to your grandma.

213
00:16:26,240 --> 00:16:28,040
She had him do all sorts of things,

214
00:16:29,480 --> 00:16:30,920
good and bad.

215
00:16:32,640 --> 00:16:34,520
She trusted him so much

216
00:16:35,680 --> 00:16:37,720
that she let him drive her car around.

217
00:16:37,800 --> 00:16:39,920
On the day it happened,

218
00:16:40,000 --> 00:16:42,880
my dad parked your grandma's car
outside our house.

219
00:16:43,320 --> 00:16:44,560
Search it thoroughly.

220
00:16:45,240 --> 00:16:46,480
There's nothing in there.

221
00:16:55,280 --> 00:16:56,280
Lieutenant!

222
00:16:58,160 --> 00:16:59,240
Then what's this?

223
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:01,400
I don't know.

224
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:02,800
Drugs, sir.

225
00:17:02,880 --> 00:17:04,280
They're not mine!

226
00:17:04,640 --> 00:17:06,360
I don't do drugs! I only drink!

227
00:17:06,440 --> 00:17:08,680
- We'll talk at the station. Move.
- I'm telling the truth!

228
00:17:09,040 --> 00:17:10,080
It's the truth!

229
00:17:10,160 --> 00:17:12,000
I swear, I've never done drugs!

230
00:17:12,080 --> 00:17:13,280
- Please!
- Get in.

231
00:17:13,360 --> 00:17:15,440
- Did you plant those drugs on me?
- Move.

232
00:17:15,520 --> 00:17:17,200
You have to believe me.

233
00:17:18,120 --> 00:17:19,520
What the fuck is going on?!

234
00:17:19,600 --> 00:17:20,640
Here, sir.

235
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:23,320
Mom, why did they arrest Dad?

236
00:17:31,360 --> 00:17:33,480
Will they let him go?

237
00:17:42,160 --> 00:17:44,560
BOONRUEANG, PROMINENT FAMILY'S DRIVER,
ARRESTED

238
00:17:44,640 --> 00:17:46,400
PORNHOVA NAME ROCKED BY SCANDAL

239
00:17:46,480 --> 00:17:49,040
OVER 50 METH PILLS FOUND
UNDER CAR SEAT IN PROMINENT FAMILY'S CAR

240
00:17:52,360 --> 00:17:55,080
OVER 50 METH PILLS FOUND
IN MARISA'S CAR

241
00:17:56,080 --> 00:17:57,880
So Non posed as Nalin

242
00:17:57,960 --> 00:17:59,920
to hide her identity.

243
00:18:00,240 --> 00:18:01,000
Yeah.

244
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:02,080
And look.

245
00:18:03,240 --> 00:18:06,080
These two kids are Bua and Rueang's children.

246
00:18:07,160 --> 00:18:08,440
Rueang?

247
00:18:08,960 --> 00:18:11,120
Your former mother-in-law's driver?

248
00:18:12,280 --> 00:18:14,680
The one she had do her dirty work?

249
00:18:15,600 --> 00:18:18,200
You ended up having to help Rueang
with his drug case,

250
00:18:18,280 --> 00:18:19,840
and the whole family nearly fell apart.

251
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,840
Can you help me, Tul?

252
00:18:23,440 --> 00:18:26,360
Do whatever it takes
to get Rueang off the hook.

253
00:18:27,040 --> 00:18:29,080
Otherwise, my husband

254
00:18:29,440 --> 00:18:31,920
won't have enough votes
to become Council president.

255
00:18:32,320 --> 00:18:34,600
The election is coming up soon.

256
00:18:36,080 --> 00:18:38,920
If I don't get elected, so be it. That's all.

257
00:18:39,000 --> 00:18:41,320
No. You have to win.

258
00:18:42,120 --> 00:18:44,280
You have to be Church Council president.

259
00:18:45,240 --> 00:18:46,480
Can you find a way, Tul?

260
00:18:47,200 --> 00:18:49,120
Tell me how much it'll cost.
I have the money.

261
00:18:49,840 --> 00:18:53,160
This is a serious case, Mother.

262
00:18:53,240 --> 00:18:55,560
It wasn't just a few pills.

263
00:18:55,640 --> 00:18:57,760
They found enough drugs to charge Rueang

264
00:18:57,840 --> 00:18:59,680
with dealing, not just using drugs.

265
00:19:00,320 --> 00:19:01,320
I think

266
00:19:01,840 --> 00:19:06,880
it's already a stretch
to keep you, the car's owner, out of this.

267
00:19:08,000 --> 00:19:09,000
Thanks.

268
00:19:09,560 --> 00:19:10,840
But that's not enough.

269
00:19:11,320 --> 00:19:13,680
You have to prove Rueang innocent.

270
00:19:14,680 --> 00:19:16,640
It's not him I'm worried about.

271
00:19:16,720 --> 00:19:19,840
You understand what our family is aiming for,
don't you?

272
00:19:20,720 --> 00:19:21,800
Tul is pregnant, Mom.

273
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,520
